{"comment_text": {"ja32:0.1": "", "ja32:0.2": "", "ja32:0.3": "", "ja32:0.4": "", "ja32:1.1": "When the Golden Swan had been elected as king of all the birds, he held a great ball to choose a husband for his daughter, the princess. She favored the glorious peacock, but when he danced, the father turned down the shameless suitor. This story draws on an Indian tradition of the peacock as being visually splendid but foolish and clumsy. ", "ja32:1.2": "", "ja32:1.3": "", "ja32:1.4": "", "ja32:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja32:0.1": "<article id='ja32'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja32:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja32:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja32:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja32:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja32:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja32:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja32:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja32:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja32:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja32:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja32:0.3": "Kulāvakavagga ", "ja32:0.4": "2. Naccajātaka ", "ja32:1.1": "“Rudaṁ manuññaṁ rucirā ca piṭṭhi, ", "ja32:1.2": "Veḷuriyavaṇṇūpanibhā ca gīvā; ", "ja32:1.3": "Byāmamattāni ca pekhuṇāni, ", "ja32:1.4": "Naccena te dhītaraṁ no dadāmī”ti. ", "ja32:2.1": "Naccajātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja32:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 32 ", "ja32:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja32:0.3": "Nests ", "ja32:0.4": "Dancing: a past life story ", "ja32:1.1": "Your cry is sweet, your back brilliant, ", "ja32:1.2": "your neck the color of sapphire, ", "ja32:1.3": "and your feathers a full fathom long; ", "ja32:1.4": "still, because of your dancing, I will not give you my daughter. ", "ja32:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja32:0.1": "", "ja32:0.2": "", "ja32:0.3": "", "ja32:0.4": "", "ja32:1.1": "", "ja32:1.2": "Veḷuriyavaṇṇūpanibhā → vaṇṇūpaṭibhā (sya1ed, sya2ed); vaṇṇasannibhā (mr) ", "ja32:1.3": "", "ja32:1.4": "", "ja32:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja32:0.1": "", "ja32:0.2": "", "ja32:0.3": "", "ja32:0.4": "", "ja32:1.1": "ms22J_70, msdiv32, ndp22.10, pts-vp-pli1.207", "ja32:1.2": "", "ja32:1.3": "", "ja32:1.4": "", "ja32:2.1": "ms22J_71"}, "keys_order": ["ja32:0.1", "ja32:0.2", "ja32:0.3", "ja32:0.4", "ja32:1.1", "ja32:1.2", "ja32:1.3", "ja32:1.4", "ja32:2.1"]}